{
  "string": {
    "ConfirmationText": "Obrigado pelo seu interesse em {name}. Para completar o processo de registo, copie o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador: {link}. Obrigado, equipe {name}.",
    "ConfirmationHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Olá,</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado pelo seu interesse em {name}. Para completar o processo de registo, siga <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;text-decoration:underline\">este link</a> ou copie o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador.</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado,<br>Equipe {name}.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ConfirmationSubject": "Confirme o seu endereço de email para registar-se em {name}",
    "RecoveryText": "Recebemos um pedido para repor a senha da sua conta. Para repor a sua senha, cole o seguinte link na barra de endereço do seu navegador web: {link}. Se não solicitou a recuperação da senha, ignore esta mensagem.",
    "RecoveryHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Recebemos um pedido para repor a senha da sua conta. Para repor a sua senha, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Repor senha &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link Repor senha acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de endereço do seu navegador web:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou a recuperação da senha, ignore esta mensagem.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "RecoverySubject": "Recuperação de Senha",
    "InviteText": "Você foi convidado para {ws}. Para se juntar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador web: {link}. Link válido por {expHours} horas.",
    "InviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Você foi convidado para <b>{ws}</b>. Para se juntar, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Juntar-se &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link de convite acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador web:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Link válido por {expHours} horas.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "InviteSubject": "Convite para {ws}",
    "OtpText": "Confirme o seu endereço de e-mail para entrar em {app}!\n\nO seu código de confirmação está abaixo - digite-o na janela onde começou a iniciar a sessão para {app}.\n\n{code}\n\nSe não solicitou este e-mail, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.",
    "OtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">Confirme o seu endereço de e-mail para entrar em {app}!</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O seu código de confirmação está abaixo - digite-o na janela onde começou a iniciar a sessão para {app}.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou este e-mail, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "SignUpOtpText": "Confirme o seu endereço de e-mail para entrar em {app}!\n\nO seu código de confirmação está abaixo - digite-o na janela onde começou o cadastro em {app}.\n\n{code}\n\nO código é válido apenas por alguns minutos. Se expirou ou você fechou a janela, abra este link para concluir o cadastro:\n{link}\n\nSe não solicitou este e-mail, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.",
    "SignUpOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:-0.4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.3\">Confirme o seu endereço de e-mail para entrar em {app}!</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O seu código de confirmação está abaixo - digite-o na janela onde começou o cadastro em {app}.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O código é válido apenas por alguns minutos. Se expirou ou você fechou a janela, <a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;text-decoration:underline\">conclua o cadastro com este link</a>.<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se não solicitou este e-mail, não há motivo para preocupação - pode ignorá-lo com segurança.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OtpSubject": "Código de confirmação {app}: {code}",
    "ResendInviteText": "Você foi convidado novamente para {ws}. Por favor, use o link a seguir para entrar: {link}. O link de convite é válido por {expHours} horas.",
    "ResendInviteHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Você foi convidado novamente para <b>{ws}</b>. Para se juntar, clique no link abaixo:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:8px\"><a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.1px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Entrar &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#A1A1AA;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Se o link de convite acima não funcionar, cole o seguinte link na barra de URL do seu navegador:<br><a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color:#71717A;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">{link}</a></p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O link de convite é válido por {expHours} horas.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "ResendInviteSubject": "Convidar novamente  para {ws}",
    "AdminOtpSubject": "Confirmation code for an administrator action",
    "AdminOtpText": "You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in {app} (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).\n\nYour confirmation code is:\n\n{code}\n\nEnter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.",
    "AdminOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">You are about to perform a sensitive administrator action in <b>{app}</b> (deleting/archiving a workspace, changing members or a subscription, renaming a URL, or deleting an account).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Your confirmation code is:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Enter it in the admin panel to confirm. If you did not initiate this action, do NOT share this code and review your account security.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "OperationOtpSubject": "Código de confirmação de uma ação no {app}",
    "OperationOtpText": "Você pediu para sair de um workspace, excluir um workspace ou excluir sua conta no {app}.\n\nSeu código de confirmação é:\n\n{code}\n\nDigite-o na janela onde você iniciou essa ação. Se não foi você que pediu isso, não compartilhe o código com ninguém e verifique a segurança da sua conta.",
    "OperationOtpHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Você pediu para sair de um workspace, excluir um workspace ou excluir sua conta no <b>{app}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Seu código de confirmação é:</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#18181B;letter-spacing:6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{code}</span></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #F4F4F5;padding-top:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Digite-o na janela onde você iniciou essa ação. Se não foi você que pediu isso, não compartilhe o código com ninguém e verifique a segurança da sua conta.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledSubject": "O workspace {ws} está agendado para exclusão",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledText": "O workspace {ws} ({url}) será excluído em {date}. {readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} one {Ele continua aberto somente leitura por mais # dia para que os dados possam ser retirados. } other {Ele continua aberto somente leitura por mais # dias para que os dados possam ser retirados. }}Depois é arquivado, e nessa data ele e o backup somem definitivamente. Até lá, qualquer proprietário pode cancelar a exclusão: {link}",
    "WorkspaceDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O workspace <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) será excluído em <b>{date}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{readonlyDays, plural, =0 {} one {Ele continua aberto somente leitura por mais # dia para que os dados possam ser retirados. } other {Ele continua aberto somente leitura por mais # dias para que os dados possam ser retirados. }}Depois é arquivado, e nessa data ele e o backup somem definitivamente.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Até lá, qualquer proprietário pode cancelar a exclusão: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletedSubject": "O workspace {ws} está sendo excluído",
    "WorkspaceDeletedText": "O workspace {ws} ({url}) está sendo excluído agora, sem o prazo habitual. Os dados e o backup não podem ser recuperados.",
    "WorkspaceDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">O workspace <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) está sendo excluído agora, sem o prazo habitual.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Os dados e o backup não podem ser recuperados.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledSubject": "Sua conta está agendada para exclusão",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledText": "Sua conta será excluída em {date}. Entrar antes dessa data permite cancelar: {link}",
    "AccountDeletionScheduledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Sua conta será excluída em <b>{date}</b>.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Entrar antes dessa data permite cancelar: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletedSubject": "Sua conta foi excluída",
    "AccountDeletedText": "Sua conta foi excluída. Tudo o que identificava você sumiu e o endereço está livre para um novo cadastro.",
    "AccountDeletedHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Sua conta foi excluída.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Tudo o que identificava você sumiu e o endereço está livre para um novo cadastro.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledSubject": "Sua conta {app} está ativa novamente",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledText": "A exclusão da sua conta {app} foi cancelada - a conta está ativa novamente.\n\nObrigado por continuar com a gente!\n\nOs workspaces que você enviou para exclusão continuam agendados - cada um precisa ser restaurado separadamente: {link}",
    "AccountDeletionCancelledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A exclusão da sua conta <b>{app}</b> foi cancelada - a conta está ativa novamente.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado por continuar com a gente!</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Os workspaces que você enviou para exclusão continuam agendados - cada um precisa ser restaurado separadamente: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledSubject": "O workspace {ws} não será excluído",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledText": "A exclusão do workspace {ws} ({url}) foi cancelada. {state, select, archived {Ele já foi arquivado - qualquer proprietário pode restaurá-lo: {link}} restoring {Ele está sendo restaurado do arquivo e estará disponível novamente em breve: {link}} other {Ele está totalmente disponível novamente: {link}}}\n\nObrigado por continuar com a gente!",
    "WorkspaceDeletionCancelledHTML": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F2F7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F2F7;padding:40px 16px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#18181B;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:24px 40px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.3px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{app}</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:36px 40px;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">A exclusão do workspace <b>{ws}</b> ({url}) foi cancelada.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">{state, select, archived {Ele já foi arquivado - qualquer proprietário pode restaurá-lo: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>} restoring {Ele está sendo restaurado do arquivo e estará disponível novamente em breve: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>} other {Ele está totalmente disponível novamente: <a href=\"{link}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#18181B;word-break:break-all;text-decoration:underline\">{link}</a>}}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#52525B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Obrigado por continuar com a gente!</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&copy; {app} &mdash; All rights reserved</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
  }
